  "answer": "An AE should correct the prospect: NovaLearn does not physically delete all customer data immediately. Under [NL-007#NL-007-S06], standard deletion is executed within 90 days after contract termination: the workspace is suspended for 30 days for data extraction, active databases/vector indexes/file stores are purged within 60 days of suspension, and backup/KMS cryptographic erasure and a Deletion Certificate follow. \"Immediate\" only means removal from active user access and TutorChat queries; physical deletion takes up to 90 days [NL-019#NL-019-S05]. Also, during an active subscription, individual document deletion is a soft delete held in a recycle bin for 30 days before permanent deletion [NL-007#NL-007-S06]. Faster timelines are an enterprise exception that must be documented in a signed DPA (e.g., 30-day active purge and 60-day backup purge) [NL-019#NL-019-S05]; otherwise the official up-to-90-day standard applies [NL-032#NL-032-S06].\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
